meta {
  name: CDR Live Stream
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: https://analytics-calling.webexapis.com/v1/cdr_stream?endTime={{startTimeMinus1Min}}&startTime={{startTimeMinus2Hrs}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  endTime: {{startTimeMinus1Min}}
  startTime: {{startTimeMinus2Hrs}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

script:pre-request {
  const nowMinus1Min = new Date();
  nowMinus1Min.setMinutes(nowMinus1Min.getMinutes() - 1);
  const isoMinus1Min = nowMinus1Min.toISOString();
  
  const nowMinus2Hrs = new Date();
  nowMinus2Hrs.setHours(nowMinus2Hrs.getHours() - 2);
  const isoMinus2Hrs = nowMinus2Hrs.toISOString();
  
  bru.setVar("startTimeMinus1Min", isoMinus1Min);
  bru.setVar("startTimeMinus2Hrs", isoMinus2Hrs);
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: false
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  Fetches Live Stream Detailed Call History (JSON, available ~1 minute after a call ends) for a
  rolling window, computed automatically by the pre-request script — the "Get Live Stream Detailed
  Call History" endpoint. Best for near-real-time dashboards.

  **Parameters**
  - `endTime` (query) — set by the pre-request script to "now minus 1 minute" (`startTimeMinus1Min`).
  - `startTime` (query) — set by the pre-request script to "now minus 2 hours" (`startTimeMinus2Hrs`).

  **Constraints**: `startTime` cannot be more than 12 hours in the past, and the window between
  `startTime` and `endTime` cannot exceed 2 hours in a single request. This endpoint is also rate
  limited to roughly 1 request per minute — expect a 403/428 if you poll faster.

  **Auth**: uses the collection's inherited OAuth2 token, which needs the `spark-admin:calls_read`
  scope.

  *Legacy note: this used to also require the token's owning admin to have "Detailed Call History
  API Access" enabled in Control Hub. That toggle is now obsolete/no longer necessary — the scope
  alone is sufficient.*

  Reference: https://developer.webex.com/calling/docs/api/v1/reports-live-stream-detailed-call-history/get-live-stream-detailed-call-history

  ---
  *Documentation written by AI (Claude) as a companion to the WebexOne 2026 API Overview session.*
}
